      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Traditional Dwelling and Outbuilding on c.0.75 Acre Site\r\nThis property offers a unique opportunity to renovate or redevelop a derelict farmhouse, situated in a stunning location overlooking Dooneen Bay, Bullens Bay, and the Old Head of Kinsale.\r\nThe property is easily accessed from the public cul-de-sac road that leads to Dooneen Bay.\r\nLocated only a short distance from the famous Old Head of Kinsale Golf course, Garrylucas & Garrettstown Blue Flag beaches, Kinsale 4.3mls, Ballinspittle 3.2mls, and Cork City & Airport 35min commute.\r\nThis property may benefit from the Vacant & Derelict Homes government grants.\r\nViewing is Highly Recommended.\r\nGPS:  51.653566, -8.551779\r\nDisclaimer: All information provided is to the best of our knowledge but is not guaranteed and should be independently verified. No warranties or representations are made regarding the accuracy, completeness, condition or planning status of the property. Interested parties should satisfy themselves as to the correctness of all information provided, including measurements, boundaries, size or acreage, BER details and services. All measurements and distances are approximate and for guidance only. Photographs and video are for illustrative purposes and may include items not included in the sale (e.g. furniture)."
